# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (context is the repo root).
# Keep the context small and cache-stable; never ship local env or build output.

# Dependencies and build output — reinstalled / recompiled inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.turbo

# VCS / CI / editor cruft
.git
.github
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
*.log

# Local env files — must never be baked into an image. Keep .env.example.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docs, specs, phase reports — not used at build or runtime
**/*.md

# Frontend is deployed separately (Vercel). Only its package.json is needed, and only
# so the workspace lockfile validates during `pnpm install`.
frontend/**
!frontend/package.json
